100 REM Dithered Option 30 Black & White Bitmap Viewer120 REM data is INPUT@5: V,X,Y where V is #dots, X & Y are dot arrays130 REM then the array is used to MOVE/DRAW Opt 30 dot object140 REM then the Opt 30 dot object is made visible150 REM last READ contains "|EOG|" to stop viewer160 INIT 170 BRIGHTNESS 1190 PRINT "Dithered Option 30 Bitmap ViewerInput Bitmap file#: ";200 INPUT F210 FIND @5:F220 PAGE 310 ROPEN 1320 VISIBILITY 1,0350 INPUT @5:V360 IF V=0 THEN 480365 DELETE X,Y380 DIM X(V),Y(V)385 INPUT @5:X,Y386 MOVE X(1),Y(1)390 FOR I=1 TO V405 RMOVE X(I)-X(1),0410 RDRAW 0,0420 NEXT I440 RCLOSE 450 REM VISIBILITY 1,1460 FIX 1470 GO TO 310480 HOME 490 END 